{"seq":2,"slug":"server-client-boundary","title":"Server/Client 边界设计与序列化约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-server-components/foundations/server-client-boundary","wordCount":1468,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"server-client-边界设计与序列化约束\">Server/Client 边界设计与序列化约束</h1><p><code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 不是&quot;让这个组件在客户端运行&quot;的简单标记——它是一条<strong>序列化边界</strong>的声明。这条边界以下的所有子组件都将被打包到客户端 bundle 中，无论它们自身是否需要交互能力。理解边界的传播规则和序列化约束，是避免 RSC 架构中最常见性能陷阱的关键。</p>\n<p>在 RSC 架构中，边界设计是架构决策而非编码细节。一个放置过高的 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 可以让整个页面退化为传统 SPA；一个设计精良的边界则让应用在保持丰富交互的同时维持极小的客户端 bundle。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 指令</strong>：文件顶部的声明，将该文件标记为客户端模块入口——其内部所有 import 的模块都进入客户端模块图</li>\n<li><strong>向下传播</strong>：<code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 文件导入的所有依赖（无论是否标记）都被纳入客户端 bundle，这是 bundler 模块图遍历的结果</li>\n<li><strong>向上隔离</strong>：<code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 文件对 Server Component 暴露的是一个&quot;引用标记&quot;，Server 端不执行其代码，只传递序列化后的 props</li>\n<li><strong>Props 序列化约束</strong>：跨越边界的 props 必须可 JSON 序列化——函数（除 Server Actions）、Class 实例、Symbol 等不可穿越</li>\n<li><strong>边界下推原则</strong>：将 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 声明推到组件树尽可能低的位置，只在真正需要交互的最小粒度组件上声明</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"边界传播规则\">边界传播规则</h2><p>当一个文件顶部声明了 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code>，它产生两个传播效果：</p>\n<p><strong>向下传播</strong>：该文件中导入（<code>import</code>）的所有模块，无论是否标记 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code>，都会被视为客户端代码并打包到客户端 bundle 中。这是 bundler 的行为——一旦进入客户端模块图，所有依赖都跟随进入。</p>\n<p><strong>向上隔离</strong>：<code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 文件对外暴露的是一个&quot;客户端组件引用&quot;。当 Server Component 导入它时，看到的是一个占位标记而非实际代码。Server Component 将 props 序列化后传给这个引用，客户端 React 运行时负责加载真实代码并实例化组件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 服务端模块图&#10;        A[page.tsx - Server] --&gt; B[header.tsx - Server]&#10;        A --&gt; C[content.tsx - Server]&#10;        A --&gt; D[&quot;chart.tsx - &#39;use client&#39;&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 客户端模块图&#10;        D --&gt; E[chart-tooltip.tsx]&#10;        D --&gt; F[chart-legend.tsx]&#10;        D --&gt; G[d3 库]&#10;        E --&gt; H[animation-utils.ts]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; I[footer.tsx - Server]&#10;&#10;    D -.-&gt;|序列化边界| J[props 必须可 JSON 序列化]\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 服务端模块图\n        A[page.tsx - Server] --&gt; B[header.tsx - Server]\n        A --&gt; C[content.tsx - Server]\n        A --&gt; D[\"chart.tsx - 'use client'\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 客户端模块图\n        D --&gt; E[chart-tooltip.tsx]\n        D --&gt; F[chart-legend.tsx]\n        D --&gt; G[d3 库]\n        E --&gt; H[animation-utils.ts]\n    end\n\n    C --&gt; I[footer.tsx - Server]\n\n    D -.-&gt;|序列化边界| J[props 必须可 JSON 序列化]</pre><p>这个传播规则导致了一个常见的严重错误——<strong><code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 放在页面层</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 错误示范：在页面顶层声明 &#39;use client&#39;&#10;// 整棵子树的所有组件代码都进入客户端 bundle&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function ProductPage() {&#10;  const [quantity, setQuantity] = useState(1);&#10;  // ... 这个页面中的所有子组件都变成了 Client Components&#10;  // 包括那些只做数据展示、本不需要 JS 的组件&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误示范：在页面顶层声明 'use client'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 整棵子树的所有组件代码都进入客户端 bundle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setQuantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ... 这个页面中的所有子组件都变成了 Client Components</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 包括那些只做数据展示、本不需要 JS 的组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 正确做法：页面保持 Server Component，只将交互部分抽为 Client&#10;// app/products/[id]/page.tsx — Server Component&#10;import { QuantitySelector } from &#39;./quantity-selector&#39;&#10;import { AddToCartButton } from &#39;./add-to-cart-button&#39;&#10;&#10;export default async function ProductPage({ params }: { params: Promise&lt;{ id: string }&gt; }) {&#10;  const { id } = await params&#10;  const product = await fetchProduct(id)&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{product.name}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{product.description}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;img src={product.image} alt={product.name} /&gt;&#10;      {/* 只有这两个交互组件是 Client Components */}&#10;      &lt;QuantitySelector max={product.stock} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;AddToCartButton productId={id} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确做法：页面保持 Server Component，只将交互部分抽为 Client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/products/[id]/page.tsx — Server Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { QuantitySelector } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './quantity-selector'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { AddToCartButton } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './add-to-cart-button'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{product.name}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{product.description}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">img src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{product.image} alt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{product.name} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 只有这两个交互组件是 Client Components */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">QuantitySelector max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{product.stock} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">AddToCartButton productId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{id} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"props-序列化约束\">Props 序列化约束</h2><p>跨越 Server/Client 边界传递的 props 必须满足序列化约束——只有可被 JSON 序列化的值才能穿越边界。React 的序列化器比标准 JSON 更宽泛，但仍有明确的限制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可序列化（允许作为 props）</th>\n<th>不可序列化（禁止作为 props）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始类型：string, number, boolean, null, undefined</td>\n<td>函数（除 Server Actions 外）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Date 对象</td>\n<td>Class 实例（自定义类）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通对象 <code>{}</code> 和数组 <code>[]</code></td>\n<td>Symbol</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React 元素（JSX）</td>\n<td>DOM 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server Actions（<code>&#39;use server&#39;</code> 函数）</td>\n<td>闭包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map, Set（React 序列化器支持）</td>\n<td>WeakMap, WeakRef</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ArrayBuffer, TypedArray</td>\n<td>Promise（除非用 <code>use()</code> 消费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FormData</td>\n<td>EventEmitter, Stream</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些约束直接影响架构设计。最常见的违反是尝试将事件处理函数作为 props 从 Server 传给 Client：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 编译错误：函数不可序列化&#10;async function ServerParent() {&#10;  const handleClick = () =&gt; { console.log(&#39;clicked&#39;) }  // 函数！&#10;  return &lt;ClientChild onClick={handleClick} /&gt;  // 报错&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：将行为逻辑移入 Client Component 内部&#10;// 或使用 Server Action 处理服务端逻辑&#10;async function ServerParent() {&#10;  const data = await fetchData()&#10;  return &lt;ClientChild data={data} /&gt;  // 只传数据&#10;}&#10;&#10;&#39;use client&#39;&#10;function ClientChild({ data }: { data: DataType }) {&#10;  const handleClick = () =&gt; {&#10;    // 行为逻辑在 Client Component 内部定义&#10;    console.log(&#39;processing&#39;, data)&#10;  }&#10;  return &lt;button onClick={handleClick}&gt;操作&lt;/button&gt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译错误：函数不可序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerParent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clicked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 函数！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ClientChild</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">handleClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：将行为逻辑移入 Client Component 内部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或使用 Server Action 处理服务端逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerParent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ClientChild</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只传数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClientChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 行为逻辑在 Client Component 内部定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> onClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">handleClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}>操作</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"边界下推策略\">边界下推策略</h2><p>&quot;边界下推&quot;（Push Client Boundary Down）是 RSC 架构中最重要的设计原则：将 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 声明推到组件树的尽可能低的位置——只在真正需要交互的最小粒度组件上声明。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;错误:边界在顶层&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;ProductPage &#39;use client&#39;&quot;] --&gt; B1[ProductImage]&#10;        A1 --&gt; C1[ProductInfo]&#10;        A1 --&gt; D1[ProductReviews]&#10;        A1 --&gt; E1[QuantityInput]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;正确:边界在叶子节点&quot;&#10;        A2[ProductPage - Server] --&gt; B2[ProductImage - Server]&#10;        A2 --&gt; C2[ProductInfo - Server]&#10;        A2 --&gt; D2[ProductReviews - Server]&#10;        A2 --&gt; E2[&quot;QuantityInput &#39;use client&#39;&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; F2[&quot;AddToCart &#39;use client&#39;&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"错误:边界在顶层\"\n        A1[\"ProductPage 'use client'\"] --&gt; B1[ProductImage]\n        A1 --&gt; C1[ProductInfo]\n        A1 --&gt; D1[ProductReviews]\n        A1 --&gt; E1[QuantityInput]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"正确:边界在叶子节点\"\n        A2[ProductPage - Server] --&gt; B2[ProductImage - Server]\n        A2 --&gt; C2[ProductInfo - Server]\n        A2 --&gt; D2[ProductReviews - Server]\n        A2 --&gt; E2[\"QuantityInput 'use client'\"]\n        A2 --&gt; F2[\"AddToCart 'use client'\"]\n    end</pre><p>实际项目中的影响量化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边界策略</th>\n<th>客户端 JS 体积</th>\n<th>首屏 LCP</th>\n<th>交互就绪时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面级 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code></td>\n<td>~320KB</td>\n<td>~2.8s</td>\n<td>~3.5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区块级 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code></td>\n<td>~120KB</td>\n<td>~1.2s</td>\n<td>~1.8s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叶子节点 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code></td>\n<td>~45KB</td>\n<td>~0.5s</td>\n<td>~0.9s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"处理第三方库的边界问题\">处理第三方库的边界问题</h2><p>第三方 UI 组件库通常没有 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 声明（它们在 RSC 出现之前就存在了），但内部使用了 <code>useState</code> 或 <code>useEffect</code>。直接在 Server Component 中使用这些库会导致运行时错误。</p>\n<p>解决方案是创建一个薄包装层（Wrapper Pattern）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// components/ui/carousel.tsx&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;// 为第三方库创建 Client Component 包装&#10;export { Carousel } from &#39;third-party-carousel-lib&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// components/ui/carousel.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 为第三方库创建 Client Component 包装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Carousel } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'third-party-carousel-lib'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/products/page.tsx — Server Component&#10;import { Carousel } from &#39;@/components/ui/carousel&#39;&#10;&#10;export default async function ProductsPage() {&#10;  const products = await fetchProducts()&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;精选商品&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      {/* Carousel 通过包装层成为 Client Component */}&#10;      &lt;Carousel items={products.map(p =&gt; ({&#10;        id: p.id,&#10;        image: p.thumbnail,&#10;        title: p.name&#10;      }))} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/products/page.tsx — Server Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Carousel } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/components/ui/carousel'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductsPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>精选商品</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* Carousel 通过包装层成为 Client Component */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Carousel items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{products.map(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        id: p.id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        image: p.thumbnail,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        title: p.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }))} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种模式有几个好处：集中管理 Client 边界声明；控制传入第三方库的 props（确保可序列化）；当第三方库升级支持 RSC 时，只需修改包装层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享组件策略\">共享组件策略</h2><p>某些组件在不同场景下可能同时作为 Server Component 和 Client Component 使用——例如一个 <code>Button</code> 组件，在导航中用作静态链接（Server），在表单中响应点击事件（Client）。</p>\n<p>策略是将组件拆分为纯展示层和交互层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// components/button/button-base.tsx — 纯展示，Server 友好&#10;// 不声明 &#39;use client&#39;，可在任何环境使用&#10;export function ButtonBase({&#10;  children,&#10;  variant = &#39;primary&#39;,&#10;  className&#10;}: ButtonBaseProps) {&#10;  const baseClass = `btn btn-${variant} ${className ?? &#39;&#39;}`&#10;  return &lt;span className={baseClass}&gt;{children}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// components/button/button-base.tsx — 纯展示，Server 友好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不声明 'use client'，可在任何环境使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonBase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'primary'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  className</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ButtonBaseProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> baseClass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `btn btn-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">variant</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">className</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''}`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">span</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> className</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">baseClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}>{children}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">span</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// components/button/interactive-button.tsx — 交互层&#10;&#39;use client&#39;&#10;import { ButtonBase } from &#39;./button-base&#39;&#10;&#10;export function InteractiveButton({&#10;  children,&#10;  onClick,&#10;  disabled,&#10;  ...baseProps&#10;}: InteractiveButtonProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;button onClick={onClick} disabled={disabled}&gt;&#10;      &lt;ButtonBase {...baseProps}&gt;{children}&lt;/ButtonBase&gt;&#10;    &lt;/button&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// components/button/interactive-button.tsx — 交互层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ButtonBase } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './button-base'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InteractiveButton</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  children</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  onClick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  disabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">baseProps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InteractiveButtonProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button onClick</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{onClick} disabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{disabled}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ButtonBase {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">baseProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{children}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ButtonBase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"边界错误的调试方法\">边界错误的调试方法</h2><p>RSC 边界相关的错误通常在构建时或运行时以特定形式出现：</p>\n<p><strong>构建时错误</strong>：&quot;Functions cannot be passed directly to Client Components unless you explicitly expose it by marking it with &#39;use server&#39;&quot;——尝试将非 Server Action 函数作为 props 传递。</p>\n<p><strong>运行时错误</strong>：&quot;useState can only be used in Client Components&quot;——一个需要状态的组件忘记声明 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>隐性问题</strong>（不报错但影响性能）：<code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 声明过高导致大量不需要交互的组件被打包。使用 Next.js Bundle Analyzer 可以可视化客户端 bundle 的组成，识别不应出现在客户端的依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# next.config.ts 中启用 Bundle Analyzer&#10;import bundleAnalyzer from &#39;@next/bundle-analyzer&#39;&#10;&#10;const withBundleAnalyzer = bundleAnalyzer({&#10;  enabled: process.env.ANALYZE === &#39;true&#39;,&#10;})&#10;&#10;export default withBundleAnalyzer(nextConfig)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># next.config.ts 中启用 Bundle Analyzer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundleAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@next/bundle-analyzer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">const</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> withBundleAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bundleAnalyzer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  enabled:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> process.env.ANALYZE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'true',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> default withBundleAnalyzer(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nextConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当分析结果显示某个模块不应出现在客户端 bundle 中时，追溯它的导入链——通常能找到一个 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 文件直接或间接导入了它。解决方案是在该 <code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 文件中移除对该模块的依赖，或将相关逻辑提升到 Server Component 层处理后通过 props 传入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>&#39;use client&#39;</code> 边界是 RSC 架构中影响最大的单一决策点。边界放置过高导致 bundle 膨胀（伪迁移），放置过低则增加组件拆分的复杂度。核心策略是&quot;边界下推&quot;——让大部分组件保持 Server 默认，只在叶子节点为真正需要交互的最小单元声明客户端边界。理解向下传播和序列化约束，才能在保持交互丰富性的同时获得 RSC 的减包优势。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"streaming-suspense\">流式渲染与 Suspense</a> 讲解边界设计如何与流式传输协作实现渐进式内容交付</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Server/Client 边界设计与序列化约束","id":"server-client-边界设计与序列化约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"边界传播规则","id":"边界传播规则"},{"level":2,"text":"Props 序列化约束","id":"props-序列化约束"},{"level":2,"text":"边界下推策略","id":"边界下推策略"},{"level":2,"text":"处理第三方库的边界问题","id":"处理第三方库的边界问题"},{"level":2,"text":"共享组件策略","id":"共享组件策略"},{"level":2,"text":"边界错误的调试方法","id":"边界错误的调试方法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RSC 心智模型与执行架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-server-components/foundations/rsc-mental-model"},"next":{"title":"流式渲染与 Suspense 协作机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-server-components/foundations/streaming-suspense"}}